dc:29] save or be @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Confused]{Confused} for 1 minute. It can attempt a new saving throw at the end of each of its turns to end the confusion.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental","poison"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"cNUnNrgmIBds31ue","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689041487000,"modifiedTime":1689041677865,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Hermetic Organs","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Savalirs possess internal organs capable of manufacturing alchemical elixirs on the fly. A savalir can choose to apply the effects of a @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.TMtQnY6yvIRCpK9v]{Juggernaut Mutagen (Greater)}, apply the effects of a @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.eQDTsetadI8u8Kc0]{Quicksilver Mutagen (Greater)}, or gain the following benefits related to a chosen energy type. If the savalir chooses the third option, they must also choose acid, cold, electricity, or fire; they gain 15 resistance to the chosen damage type, add 1d6 damage of the chosen type with their melee Strikes, and change their caustic spit's damage entirely to the chosen type. Whichever effect the savalir chooses, the effect lasts for only 1 minute. Once active, a savalir can change the active elixir on its turn as a free action, but if the current effect hasn't yet expired, the savalir must succeed at a @Check[type:flat|dc:7] or become @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Sickened]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.Item.9o0BdtEI0jrlxU5p]{Effect: Hermetic Organs}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["alchemical","elixir","polymorph"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"yyTa8rRx4XBlAgDe","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689041487393,"modifiedTime":1689042133238,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Sneak Attack","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The savalir deals 2d6 precision damage to off-guard targets.</p>\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SneakAttack]</p>"},"rules":[{"category":"precision","diceNumber":1,"dieSize":"d6","key":"DamageDice","predicate":["target:condition:off-guard",{"or":["item:trait:agile","item:trait:finesse",{"and":["item:ranged",{"not":"item:thrown-melee"}]}]}],"selector":"strike-damage"},{"domain":"all","key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.TOTMToggle.OffGuard","option":"target:condition:off-guard","toggleable":"totm"}],"slug":"sneak-attack","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":